[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4787128206","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120597#issuecomment-4787128206","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120597","id":4787128206,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHVXHjg","user":{"login":"corgifist","id":86985149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTg1MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86985149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist","html_url":"https://github.com/corgifist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T08:01:22Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T08:01:22Z","body":"I investigated this issue a little bit further and this is what I discovered:\n* The same scene (with `Basis Universal` compression enabled) fully works on mobile devices (at least it does on my iPhone)\n* Turns out, `Basis Universal` compression for Web works, but only if the compressed texture's resolution is a power of 4\n\n<img width=\"1086\" height=\"772\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0a58b2a-0db8-47c6-a85d-4efcdec746e2\" />\n\n<img width=\"1440\" height=\"900\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64c21b7f-b798-410f-9dff-60c59f62e523\" />\n\nAfter googling the problem a coupe of times I found out, that `Basis Universal` uses BC compression format for desktop platforms, which requires texture's resolution to be a power of 4\nMobile platforms use different compression format which doesn't pose this requirement\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4787128206/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4787305379","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120597#issuecomment-4787305379","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120597","id":4787305379,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHVh7ow","user":{"login":"corgifist","id":86985149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTg1MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86985149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist","html_url":"https://github.com/corgifist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T08:23:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T08:23:58Z","body":"The same test scene on desktop and mobile:\n\n<img width=\"1552\" height=\"892\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/731755be-6a47-40c6-93bc-3e367e9b90f9\" />\n\n<img width=\"585\" height=\"1266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48020991-27f8-468c-89b8-b02d618e7379\" />\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4787305379/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4789197502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120597#issuecomment-4789197502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120597","id":4789197502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHXVavg","user":{"login":"corgifist","id":86985149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTg1MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86985149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist","html_url":"https://github.com/corgifist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T12:17:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T13:21:53Z","body":"Workaround found:\nIn the import tab make sure `Mipmaps > Generate` is set to On\nFor some reason, generating mipmaps fixes the rendering and the scene behaves the same on these two platforms\n\n<img width=\"293\" height=\"501\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9aac6c63-f920-4384-a252-9698c30a1328\" />\n\n(Value of Limit doesn't matter because this option is unimplemented yet)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4789197502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4803694804","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120597#issuecomment-4803694804","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120597","id":4803694804,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHlKQ1A","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-25T20:04:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T20:04:39Z","body":"The resolution being a multiple of the block size (4 in this case) is a requirement for all compressed formats, actually. WebGL often doesn't allow setting the resolution to a different value than the texture's actual size (#104260). The workaround works since the code for padding the textures is kind of broken (it only pads them if the texture has mipmaps). \n\n#113185 should fix this and a bunch of other issues, if you are able to test it please let me know if it works.\n\nIn the meantime, I'm working on a smaller fix that can be backported to 4.7","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4803694804/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4808529888","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120597#issuecomment-4808529888","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120597","id":4808529888,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHpxX4A","user":{"login":"corgifist","id":86985149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTg1MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86985149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist","html_url":"https://github.com/corgifist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-26T10:03:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T10:03:28Z","body":"Hi! Thank you for correcting me a little bit. I'll test it a little bit later and let you know if the issue is fixed :)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4808529888/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4809456440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120597#issuecomment-4809456440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120597","id":4809456440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHqp7OA","user":{"login":"corgifist","id":86985149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTg1MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86985149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist","html_url":"https://github.com/corgifist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-26T12:12:05Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T12:12:05Z","body":"Hello again! Can confirm your pull request fixes the issue perfectly, thank you for your hard work ^^\n\n<img width=\"1440\" height=\"779\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/as