x is smaller in scope so it can be safely backported to 4.7.1\n\n> Shall I close the issue now or wait until the pull request is merged?\n\nPlease leave it open, it will close automatically when the pull request is merged","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4810109952/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4811761632","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120597#issuecomment-4811761632","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120597","id":4811761632,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHs2n4A","user":{"login":"corgifist","id":86985149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTg1MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86985149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist","html_url":"https://github.com/corgifist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/corgifist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-26T17:14:50Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T17:14:50Z","body":"Yup, #120648 does also work. Not even a warning in the console!\n\n<img width=\"1439\" height=\"786\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-at